NOTE: This project has used the following datasets as part of the training, development and experimentation phases:
- *UAV images of native grassland with rosette annotations* - Amparo Quiñones, Jean Savian, Andrés Hirigoyen, João Valente (https://zenodo.org/records/14771664).
- VineLiDAR: High-resolution UAV-LiDAR vineyard dataset acquired over two years in northern Spain - Sergio Vélez, Mar Ariza-Sentís & João Valente (https://zenodo.org/records/8113105).
- *A Multispectral UAV Imagery Dataset of Wheat, Soybean and Barley Crops in East Kazakhstan* - Almasbek Maulit, Aliya Nugumanova, Kurmash Apayev, Yerzhan Baiburin, Maxim Sutula (https://www.mdpi.com/2306-5729/8/5/88)

They are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY 4.0).
Please cite the dataset authors as required by CC-BY 4.0.